$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Kandathu" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> planned their stratigies through the day and now plan to attack one and anothers base since it's now After Dark! There's a hidden portal known to be in this area that will give a great strategic advantage to the team that finds it. But who will it be!! Good Luck !" @
